'''Viper''' (Japanese: '''バイパー''' ''Viper'') is a [[character of the day]] in [[Pokémon Chronicles]], who appeared in ''[[HS12|Training Daze]]''. He is the Drill Sergeant of the [[Team Rocket Academy]] and trains new recruits for [[Team Rocket]].

He was impressed by [[Butch]] and [[Cassidy]]'s teamwork, as well as [[Jessie]], despite the fact that she had gone through several partners over two months. Viper reported to {{an|Giovanni}} that Jessie should receive further training because she contains a special quality unseen in anyone else. The Team Rocket Boss agreed with the recommendation and Viper formally introduced Jessie, [[James]], and {{MTR}} to each other before they could officially declare themselves a part of Team Rocket.

Viper provided clear instructions to each of the training rounds, and was disguised as a red {{p|Snorlax}} for the final trial. At the Team Rocket Academy graduation ceremony, he declared Jessie, James, and Meowth fledgling members of Team Rocket, while Butch and Cassidy were granted the villains-in-training status.

